# This project's environment for test chats: the Test tab in Zenera Lite.
#
# Read instead of .env, not on top of it: Zenera Lite runs test chats with
# ZEN_ENV_FILE=.env.test, and only one file is ever read. So everything a test
# chat needs goes here — a sandbox account's token, a staging or mock base url.
# Edits reach the next test chat turn; nothing has to be restarted.
#
# It is in .gitignore, like .env: a test credential is still a credential.
# Name any variable you add here in .env.example as well.

# ACME_API_TOKEN=
# ACME_BASE_URL=https://staging.example.test
